Subject: [PATCH 02/17] Fix GHSA-62xp-839h-2637: FastCGI allowed_clients
 compared only 96 bits of IPv6 addresses

(cherry picked from commit dcdfcf86fcf7f42fa98dd3d000f310ebdad41965)
---
 main/fastcgi.c                                |  2 +-
 ...a-62xp-839h-2637-ipv6-allowed-clients.phpt | 52 +++++++++++++++++++
 ...xp-839h-2637-v4mapped-allowed-clients.phpt | 52 +++++++++++++++++++
